note as DecisionTree
  **Which diagram should I use?**
  
  🔍 **Understanding the system?**
     → Start with ClassDiagram.puml
  
  🎨 **Working on circuit plotting?**
     → CircuitModule.puml
  
  ⚙️ **Configuring plot settings?**
     → SettingsHierarchy.puml
  
  ➕ **Adding a new plot parameter?**
     → CircuitModule.puml (shows Strategy pattern)
  
  📊 **Understanding results classes?**
     → ClassDiagram.puml (Results section)
  
  🏗️ **Working on model/studies?**
     → ClassDiagram.puml
end note

